## The basis

**Quotation for commentary and criticism, cited in place, with a link to the source.** This is a
repository whose subject *is* the evaluation of these sources. Every quoted passage sits next to a
reading of it, usually a disagreement; several exist specifically so that a later reader can check
that the reading was fair. Removing the quotations would not shorten the record, it would make it
unauditable — which is the one thing this repository is built not to be.

Nothing quoted is redistributed as a standalone copy. There is no vendored rulebook, no mirrored
PDF and no scraped archive in the tree. The quotations live inside the analysis that cites them.

